 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? You can eat them on plate without a mess. Sandwiches, pasta, noodle soups, popcorn, corn on cob, apples and citrus roll nicely. Roughly five minutes per side of bird you lose more with the skin, so ten minutes each side is about right. Go for the salad and sandwich instead. Cooler might not stop it from running a little, so keep an eye on it. Pop a layer of hard butter crackers on top of sandwich. They' stay dry and the butter won't melt everything.",
